      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shi Zong of the rockman tribe declares he is willing to join the four races alliance so that from that day the four races shall be united. Gu Immortals take turns accepting the effect of the information path dao marks and become members. Fang Yuan joins because the situation forces him and because the alliance makes it easier to borrow strength for cultivation. In this four races alliance the inkman tribe is the weakest.",
